{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606030/extras/Untitled.png?t=1742848498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dr. Suun</strong> is a relentless horror experience where every step pulls you deeper into a nightmare. Playing as <strong>James</strong>, you explore an abandoned hospital with a dark past, uncovering unsettling truths as reality blurs into terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the greater the danger. Shadows hide more than just secrets, and when fear takes shape, running may be your only option. Will you escape, or will the hospital claim you like the rest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606030/extras/Untitled_1_.png?t=1742848498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to solve puzzles by finding keys and unlocking doors. Each door grants access to new rooms, uncovering secrets and pushing you further into the depths of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606030/extras/image_2025-03-21_153833202.png?t=1742848498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade a relentless pursuer as you explore the hospital. Stay on the move, but be cautious\u2014your enemy\u2019s behavior is unpredictable, keeping you on edge at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606030/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-21_154801GUY.png?t=1742848498\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606030?t=1742848498","background_raw":"https://st